  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-07-04.4023.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 78 min [1]\n- **ajc03745_mymorningjacket_2006-07-04**: source not stated; 13 songs; 78 min [2]\n- **mmj2006-07-04.fm.flac16**: FM broadcast; 13 songs; 74 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [3]. Said about its sound: The recording offers good sound quality and solid performances [5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Andrew Bird joined on violin and whistling at the Taste of Chicago [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-07-04.4023.flac16**: taped by George Wang; transferred by George Wang; source: DPA 4023 > Sonosax SX-M2 > Mogami interconnect > Edirol R1 @ 24/44.1; 40 ft. center [1]\n- **ajc03745_mymorningjacket_2006-07-04**: taped by Aadam Jacobs; source: Radio Broadcast [2]. Also: Loan from Aadam Jacobs Audio Archive, transferred via Tascam gear [2]\n- **mmj2006-07-04.fm.flac16**: taped by Brian Skalinder; transferred by Brian Skalinder; source: FM Broadcast (WXRT) > NAD 4300 > Edirol R-4 [3]. Also: Captured from WXRT FM broadcast, converted via Edirol R-4 recorder [3]",
